#. module: delivery_sendcloud
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/delivery_sendcloud/models/sendcloud_service.py:0
msgid ""
"\n"
"Additionally, some individual product(s) are too heavy for the heaviest "
"available shipping method.\n"
"                             \n"
"Divide the quantity of the following product(s) across your packages if "
"possible or choose another carrier:\n"
"\t%s"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"ນອກຈາກນີ້, ສິນຄ້າບາງລາຍການມີນ້ຳໜັກຫຼາຍເກີນໄປ ສຳລັບວິທີການຈັດສົ່ງທີ່ຮອງຮັບນ້ຳໜັກໄດ້ຫຼາຍທີ່ສຸດ.\n"
"                             \n"
"ກະລຸນາແບ່ງຈຳນວນສິນຄ້າຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ໃສ່ແຕ່ລະຫໍ່ເຄື່ອງ ຖ້າເປັນໄປໄດ້ ຫຼື ເລືອກຜູ້ໃຫ້ບໍລິການຂົນສົ່ງອື່ນ:\n"
"\t%s"

#. module: delivery_sendcloud
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/delivery_sendcloud/models/sendcloud_service.py:0
msgid ""
"\n"
"Try to distribute your products across your packages so that they weigh less "
"than %(max_weight)s %(unit)s or choose another carrier."
msgstr ""
"\n"
"ພະຍາຍາມກະຈາຍສິນຄ້າຂອງທ່ານໃສ່ແຕ່ລະຫໍ່ເຄື່ອງ ເພື່ອໃຫ້ນ້ຳໜັກໜ້ອຍກວ່າ %(max_weight)s %(unit)s ຫຼື ເ"
"ລືອກຜູ້ໃຫ້ບໍລິການຂົນສົ່ງອື່ນ."

#. module: delivery_sendcloud
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/delivery_sendcloud/models/sendcloud_service.py:0
msgid "%(partner_name)s email required"
msgstr "ຕ້ອງການອີເມວ %(partner_name)s"

